## 3. What the Platform Will Actually Do (If You Prove the Scam)
If you provide an official statement proving the buyer reversed the MTN MoMo funds after getting the crypto, the platform will take the following actions:

* 
* They will permanently ban the buyer's account and blacklist their ID. [4] 
* If that buyer still has any other crypto assets sitting in their funding or spot wallets on the exchange, the platform will freeze those assets and may use them to reimburse you.
* The Catch: Professional scammers instantly withdraw the stolen crypto to an external private wallet the second they receive it. If their exchange account balance is already zero, the platform has nothing left to freeze, leaving you with a total loss.
